              "$Comment": "--- Farm-Loop: the Workstation (WorkstationFuelTickSystem) picks the next block and work type (till/plant/water/harvest-detect) within WorkConfig.FieldRadius/FieldMaxHeight in serpentine order and writes both to BudComponent - this WorkTarget Sensor only reads the position back, no scanning/range here. Seeks toward it every tick; FarmWorkAction's own canExecute re-checks interaction distance and the field radius, then branches on the assigned work type internally, so approaching and working share one Instruction. No Timeout wrapper, no second Action - see docs/bud-worker-mode-plan.md, 'Phase 5 — Drei tragende Regeln für Phase 6-10'. ---",
              "Sensor": {
                "Type": "And",
